%N A390016 Maximum halting time across all Wolfram 3-state 2-symbol Turing machines started with n on the tape.
%C A390016 Only computations which halt are considered.
%C A390016 For n = 1 through 50, the maximum was established by classifying all 2985984 rule tables: each run was either simulated to a halt or proved never to halt. - _Gregory Morse_, Nov 24 2026
